+  - orch gitops sync
+  - orch gitops delete
+- Validate YAML through existing admission path.
+- Emit events and audit logs.
+- Add tests using a local fixture repo.
+- Do not store Git credentials in plaintext.
+- Update docs/GITOPS.md.
+
+At the end:
+- Run go test ./...
+```
